      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "We believe this issue has been addressed in the most recent patch release of VRChat, 2025.1.1p1 (build 1568). If you are still encountering issues in this latest version, please open a new bug report including the ID of at least one avatar suffering from the issue and steps we can follow to reproduce the problem you're seeing.\n\nThis issue is believed to be caused by gestures being culled at a distance on remote avatars, rather than being related to recent changes to distance hiding that only come into effect when distance hiding is explicitly turned on.",
